The support note 'GBAD reload: not established. No supplier with TargetTypes=LandUnit was identified' is wrong about the collection. LandUnit suppliers exist and the inventory documents them (lens us-air-and-land):
- tgt_ammo_depot_small (vanilla, Soviet variants, AmmoCapacity 200,000, MaxAmmoPoints commented out);
- usa_car_m923 (vanilla, Nation=US, 4,500, MaxAmmoPoints 200, 0.5 mi);
- usa_car_hemtt (3605013271, US, 13,500, cap 200);
- nv_headquarters (3605013271, Vietnam, effectively unlimited).
The Rapier stand-in's round raf_rapier (vanilla) costs AmmoPoints=90, declares no SupplyCategory and is magazine-fed (AssociatedMagazine=WeaponMagazineMissile). It therefore passes the cap and both gates in data.
